### Challenge (public)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/challenge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sSessionTest11111111111111111111111111111"
}

### Unsigned session is rejected
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sSessionTest11111111111111111111111111111",
  "displayName": "Session Tester",
  "role": "musician"
}

### Signed session (replace signature with the wallet signature of the challenge message)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sSessionTest11111111111111111111111111111",
  "signature": "<base58 signature of the challenge message>",
  "displayName": "Session Tester",
  "role": "musician"
}

### Current session without a token is 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/current

### Current session with the bearer from a signed login is 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
